Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think back to the time\Nwhen my search first began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left behind those shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the endless everlasting\Nworld out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.91,0:00:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, somewhere, I'll finally see the\Nlight I have searched for everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the summer sun is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shaking the sails of my heart. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.69,0:01:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brand new world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.51,0:01:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that has been hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has opened up its doors for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.95,0:01:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A way from the moon's sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.95,0:01:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wearing in the troubled waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From all despair I can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the horizon on the other side is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.27,0:01:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.61,0:01:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is what I am for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I've traveled far\Nfrom where my search began,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over seas of green and shores of sand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.35,0:01:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through the endless\Neverlasting world out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.05,0:01:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someday somewhere I'll finally see the\Nlight I have searched for everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.69,0:01:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Own stupid fault she'd\Nbe okay if she hadn't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:02:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,helped us and I'm not\Nsure she can trust that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.17,0:02:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky knight he pretty\Nmuch gives me the creeps
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.53,0:02:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's kind of old and weird but he doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seem like that bad of a guy there was no\Nother choice I want to protect her but it's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.93,0:02:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not like we could have\Nbrought her along with
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us man this piece of\Njunk is slow of course
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it is it's got to be several times heavier\Nthan a standard waiver what'd you expect.
