Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.35,0:02:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys where did that\Nhuge forest come from is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that the upper yard I don't\Nremember this being on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.73,0:02:33.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the map wait no there is\Nsupposed to be a forest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.85,0:02:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ahead but I don't see\Nany warning about how big
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it is this cannot be\Nright who knows how old
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.71,0:02:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that map is we know it can\Nbe traced back a couple
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.59,0:02:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hundred years but who's\Nto say it hasn't been
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.27,0:02:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around longer the forest\Nmay have been a fraction of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.83,0:02:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of its size when that map was made.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.13,0:02:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is I gotta\Nclimb one of those trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.53,0:02:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.87,0:03:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is it, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna chicken\Nout, now's the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, if you don't mind, I was\Nkind of thinking I'd like to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then why didn't you ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.89,0:03:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you calm down?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.47,0:03:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.95,0:03:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you notice anything strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all these shipwrecks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.87,0:03:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, they didn't run aground,\Nthey were sliced in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The woods are full of noises! Relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.21,0:03:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.35,0:03:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.89,0:03:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, a handful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.31,0:04:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stroke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stroke!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.33,0:04:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sickle monster! Hang on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.05,0:04:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.59,0:04:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paddle like crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.29,0:04:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where you're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.29,0:04:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Faster, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.37,0:04:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.28,0:04:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't working!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, take the wheel! Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's in front of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, just hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.73,0:04:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man dodged it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.61,0:04:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.59,0:04:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we finally outran it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.27,0:05:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's too late to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even see the entrance anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.55,0:05:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.85,0:05:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd die, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.91,0:05:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that a big snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looked like a giant lamprey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky lamprey, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.61,0:05:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that big will do more\Nthan just suck a little blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neatest forest ever, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neat forest my butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this is our so-called\Nordeal, then I quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.11,0:05:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't quit yet, we just got here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't spend any more time on\Nthis milky road than necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.59,0:05:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we're asking for certain death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.35,0:05:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is! Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.77,0:05:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.01,0:05:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if he gets swallowed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why hasn't he come back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.25,0:06:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, please be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't think he got eaten, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro's fish food!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.27,0:06:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he had been eaten, the clouds\Nwould have turned red by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.35,0:06:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you stay so calm\Nat a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so done with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.31,0:06:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you one thing, we are not\Ngoing to make it across by swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of swordsman punches a\Nshark instead of using his blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thing's for certain, we're definitely\Nsomewhere in the middle of Upper Yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:07:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, this seems to be some sort of\Naltar for sacrifices. Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a giant head blocking our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite. It's a statue. Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it looks like a total dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, look, there's four entrances.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.13,0:07:20.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how much you want to bet all four\Nof them lead to different places.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.73,0:07:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think we get to take our pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it me, or do none of these things\Nreally sound like much of an ordeal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one should we choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.87,0:07:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for judgment, criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.91,0:07:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no choice but to receive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Select a gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.19,0:07:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Select from four ordeals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.19,0:07:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For you, there can be no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.55,0:08:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may choose your own trial,\Nbut we will decide your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swamp
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isle
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.03,0:08:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strain
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spheres
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.39,0:08:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choose your path, criminals?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do we choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, let's go with spheres\NWhy do you like that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.47,0:08:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spheres are like balls, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds fun That's your only reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.83,0:08:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're ordeals, they're not supposed to\Nbe fun Not that I'm disagreeing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.19,0:08:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spheres is definitely the one that\Ndoesn't sound too violent at least to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.31,0:08:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't let your guard down, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.71,0:08:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, these are God's islands,\Nten thousand meters above sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.61,0:08:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything can happen. Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.59,0:09:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Driver, would you mind\Nnot shutting your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.51,0:09:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's just as dark with them open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.59,0:09:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, what if this is\Nlike one of those games?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, if you pick the right\Ndoor, then you get a prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you pick the wrong one...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.87,0:09:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if we picked wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.93,0:09:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why couldn't you have\Nmentioned this before, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.59,0:09:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, if you pick the wrong one,\Nthen you fall off the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.91,0:09:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you say something so stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.33,0:09:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're thousands of meters in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how many times your life can
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,flash before your eyes\Nduring a fall like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I don't want to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.71,0:09:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are both being idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing like that's gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.65,0:10:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.39,0:10:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.30,0:10:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an entire school of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.17,0:10:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.07,0:10:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if that first one was any indication,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.07,0:10:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're not going to have\Nmuch luck fighting them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.15,0:10:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't stay here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.87,0:10:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leaving us here was that\Nlobster's idea of a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.73,0:10:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.71,0:10:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this is the heaven's judgment\Nwe've been hearing so much about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.51,0:10:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except you'd think this god would try\Nsomething a little flasher, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.77,0:10:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, couldn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never met the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what the solution is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.99,0:10:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We definitely can't set sail\Nwith the hull looking like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.59,0:11:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, try to figure out\Na way to fix the ship. Me? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should he fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.61,0:11:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna find a way into the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should probably make\Nthis our base of operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.45,0:11:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys can keep a lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Luffy and the\Nothers are headed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like they say, if you get lost, you\Nshould stay where you are, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.83,0:11:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't that apply to you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, if you want to go into the forest,\Nwell, I guess that's okay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you haven't really told us what for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's supposed to be some\Nkind of god on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.03,0:11:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to meet him. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.79,0:11:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a terrible idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what are you going to\Ndo when you actually find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Depends on if he behaves himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.05,0:11:54.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you're the bravest person I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.97,0:11:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about his priests?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.39,0:11:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You going to beat them up too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:11:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.60,0:12:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing we need\Nis you pissing off a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.79,0:12:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of not smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.63,0:12:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time I'm done with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this god's going to bow before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.91,0:12:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in him anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I care about pissing him off?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.01,0:12:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, powerful one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want you to know I don't\Nagree with my idiot shipmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.71,0:12:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't even like him that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That vine looks pretty sturdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.71,0:12:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, excellent idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.71,0:12:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind if I tag along, swordsman?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, as long as you promise not\Nto slow me down. Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.81,0:12:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.95,0:12:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.31,0:12:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least a thousand years have\Npassed since this altar was built.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.31,0:12:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A thousand years?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.17,0:12:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sense of history here is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.81,0:12:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gives me chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.35,0:12:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A place as ancient as this is sure to\Nbe filled with all kinds of old relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine all the valuables\Nwe could discover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.61,0:13:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think, the possibilities are endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.81,0:13:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, I thought you were too scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.35,0:13:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for history.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.99,0:13:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.91,0:13:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's official.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.29,0:13:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's lost his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.37,0:13:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.85,0:13:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks easy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.63,0:13:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is higher up than\NI thought. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.23,0:13:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you fall, you'll most certainly die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's supposed to be\Nyour idea of helping?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.95,0:14:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.99,0:14:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dead if I fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.25,0:14:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.03,0:14:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.33,0:14:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too fast! I'm in a crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.15,0:14:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.23,0:14:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gutless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.23,0:14:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for catching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.67,0:14:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you should have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.19,0:14:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That had nothing to do with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.25,0:14:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This forest is even bigger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.19,0:14:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Chopper! You're\Nin charge of the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.45,0:14:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.43,0:14:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, everyone be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't take too long, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:15:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess nami will be alright\Nsince she's with robin and zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends are all so\Nbrave and adventurous!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.05,0:15:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too scared to go, but maybe someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm really lucky, I can\Nbe brave like them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.81,0:15:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, if I can't be brave, I\Ncan at least make myself useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being left alone in the\Nmiddle of a dangerous forest
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.13,0:15:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to fix our ship is proof\Nthat everyone must trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.53,0:15:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I have to do my very best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.19,0:15:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just little old me all by\Nmyself in the big, scary forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.39,0:15:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.17,0:15:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna protect me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.33,0:15:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.19,0:15:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seriously thought we were falling\Nall the way back to the blue sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.87,0:15:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because somebody had to\Nmake up a lane story to scare us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.91,0:15:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.99,0:15:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was a goner too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.91,0:15:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, so what is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:15:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A forest. With balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.05,0:16:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're balls made of island\Ncloud awesome they look like
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.81,0:16:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really big snowflakes now what\Ncould be scary about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.19,0:16:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see you stop it's okay heads up the milky\Nroad is leading us up into the trees
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i just don't see how this is an ordeal\Ndo you not yet it'd be great if there was
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.79,0:16:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing ahead but somehow i doubt it what\Nif it was like one of those games and we
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.59,0:16:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,picked the right door and now all we have\Nto do is float around in this giant snow
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.11,0:16:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking for the others,\Nyeah, maybe that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're still being idiots they think we're
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.85,0:16:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,criminals i doubt they'll let us off that\Neasy use your brains for once i wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be surprised if there were more traps like\Nthe ones earlier we have to stay sharp
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.23,0:17:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's just keep moving what are you the\Ncaptain now can we at least have a snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.93,0:17:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh yeah what you got in the bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.11,0:17:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sanji come on give me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no no snacks but sanji we need to keep our
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.71,0:17:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strength just a little something i said no
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now listen it's really simple i'm going to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.61,0:17:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keep steering you guys\Nkeep watch out the sides
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.43,0:17:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whoa i didn't realize how high up we were
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.77,0:17:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting something's not\Nright—it's too quiet there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.43,0:17:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are four priests so i\Nassume each tunnel would
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.75,0:17:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lead to one why haven't\Nwe seen any of them yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.35,0:17:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i got a bad feeling about\Nthis okay okay i got it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.21,0:17:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i got it gosh i thought\Ni told you to keep watch
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, didn't see that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.11,0:18:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.02,0:18:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a cloud ball! Kick it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.93,0:18:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do not like the idea of\Nbeing surrounded by snake eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.01,0:18:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.15,0:18:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.21,0:18:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silly children These are surprise clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.13,0:18:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never know what's\Ngoing to come out of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.57,0:18:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pete, where's that voice coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.03,0:18:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you picked my\Nchallenge, the Ordeal of Spears!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:55.59,0:19:00.51,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,688)\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\c&H3A3E38&\3c&H2B2E31&\blur0.7\fad(732,0)\1a&HFF&\t(572,732,\1a&H00&)\b1}Satori of the Forest\NSkypiea Priest{PJ}
Dialogue: 2,0:18:55.59,0:19:00.51,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,688)\fnFOT-Greco Std DB Strp\bord0\c&HFAFDFA&\4a&HFF&\blur0.7\fad(732,0)\b1}Satori of the Forest\NSkypiea Priest{PJ}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.15,0:19:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, is that a talking dumpling?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.97,0:19:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is one of Inaru's priests?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the ordeal, ball guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.37,0:19:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop with the dancing\Nand tell us who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.83,0:19:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta say, he's not as\Nbright as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.87,0:19:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't Nami and the old guy\Nsay these priests were strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.53,0:19:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm not seeing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dumpling!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.49,0:19:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami and the others better be safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.35,0:19:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sacrifices?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.69,0:19:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll escape or they won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't really matter which.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.99,0:19:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they escape, they'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.49,0:19:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're sacrificed,\Nwell, they'll die then too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.49,0:19:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.87,0:19:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'd be more worried about yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.91,0:19:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to beat me if you\Nplan on going any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.49,0:19:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I really don't see that happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming right for us, Luffy. Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.17,0:20:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.59,0:20:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.15,0:20:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're going to stretch?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.29,0:20:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.03,0:20:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy you're okay aren't you a hit\Nlike that couldn't have hurt you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.65,0:20:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That much well, you see? It's not what
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.45,0:20:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call a normal hit? I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.89,0:20:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not normal right foot high kick
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.45,0:21:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only the most well trained will grant
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.49,0:21:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The power of mantra. Impossible!\NHow could he predict my attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.29,0:21:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.41,0:21:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I warned you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.37,0:21:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.37,0:21:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shock destroys the\Nbody from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.83,0:21:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.49,0:21:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did that bastard do to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.97,0:21:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.61,0:21:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.87,0:21:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am one of the four priests\Nof the almighty Enel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.65,0:21:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who watch over Upper Yard?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.01,0:21:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and see to the judgment of\Ncriminals like yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.47,0:22:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I own the birth in this lost forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.39,0:22:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lost forest? Why, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.03,0:22:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My forest in all its glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.73,0:22:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, your boat will\Nbe lost in its illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.31,0:22:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're using that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She will now speed along the Milky Road,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.93,0:22:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eventually weaving her way\Nto this forest's only exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.83,0:22:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I don't need to tell you this,\Nbut if you lose a dial boat in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.71,0:22:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's the same as losing your\Nway to the sacrificial altar
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.03,0:22:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that means you will have to find the boat
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.33,0:22:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and board her before\Nthat happens of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.39,0:22:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my hundreds of surprise clouds and\Ni will never allow you that chance
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.29,0:22:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that seem unfair to you boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.39,0:22:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the upper yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ordeal of spheres.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.71,0:23:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a 10% survival rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.97,0:23:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.33,0:23:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Survival rate?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.97,0:23:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just 10 %?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.13,0:23:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,10%?

